# Input
```css
/* should not generate diagnostics */
$start: top;
$end: bottom;

.distinct {
  border: {
    radius: 1px;
    width: 2px;
  }
  border-color: red;
  margin: {
    top: 1px;
  }
  margin: {
    bottom: 1px;
  }
}

.interpolated {
  border-#{$start}: {
    width: 1px;
  }
  border-#{$end}: {
    width: 2px;
  }
}

```
